TITLE

NODE-OS CONTROL SURFACE + SHELL V1


MISSION

Replace the current game-like module launcher with the first mature NODE-OS
Home and shared normal Shell presentation.

NODE-OS should feel like the technical operating surface of a specialized
personal pocket computer:

- serious
- compact
- precise
- restrained
- highly usable
- recognizably an operating system
- purpose-built for networking and systems work

The result must not feel like:

- a smartphone app grid
- a game HUD
- a mission dashboard
- a cyberpunk prop
- a collection of generic web cards

This slice changes presentation and Shell interaction only.

It must not introduce new gameplay state or future systems.


