ARCHITECTURAL INVARIANTS

Preserve:

- NODE-OS is Firmware of the player's local Device, not the universal
  Synthesis interface
- shell navigation remains presentation state
- Device state remains canonical game state
- stable IDs remain identity
- displayName remains a mutable presentation attribute
